{"type":"message","id":"26634859","parentId":"e15b94b2","timestamp":"2026-04-01T08:50:39.595Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_1o4bqfqa8h69l7q9mhhsst55","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\r\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\r\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-03-31T09:32:53.337436+00:00\",\r\n  \"stage1\": {\r\n    \"identifier\": \"天弘余额宝货币市场基金\",\r\n    \"lookup_result\": {\r\n      \"identifier\": \"天弘余额宝货币市场基金\",\r\n      \"queries\": [\r\n        \"company profile stock code industry classification 天弘余额宝货币市场基金\",\r\n        \"stock company information industry profile 天弘余额宝货币市场基金\",\r\n        \"equity profile code name industry 天弘余额宝货币市场基金\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"results\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"query\": \"company profile stock code industry classification 天弘余额宝货币市场基金\",\r\n          \"total\": 5,\r\n          \"results\": [\r\n            {\r\n              \"tool_id\": \"mcp_gildata.fundindustrydistributionreport.v1\",\r\n              \"name\": \"FundIndustryDistributionReport\",\r\n              \"description\": \"基金行业分布\\n\\n获取基金在申万、中信等行业分类下的持仓占比，分析配置结构。\",\r\n              \"examples\": {\r\n                \"sample_parameters\": {\r\n                  \"query\": \"华夏成长混合\"\r\n                }\r\n              },\r\n              \"provider_description\": \"Gildata MCP server providing financial data including market quotes, fundamentals, and research.\",\r\n              \"expected_cost\": \"10\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"tool_id\": \"ths_ifind.fund_analysis.v1\",\r\n              \"name\": \"iFinD Fund Analysis\",\r\n              \"description\": \"Query NAV snapshots and static profiles for China public mutual funds.\\n- query_type='nav': Retrieve fund NAV on a specific date, including unit NAV, cumulative NAV, NAV growth rate, and subscription/redemption status. Requires codes (.OF format) and date.\\n- query_type='info': Retrieve static fund profile including fund type, inception date, current manager, custodian, management/custody fee rates, and performance benchmark. Requires codes (.OF format) only; date is ignored.\\nFund codes must use the .OF suffix, e.g. '110011.OF,000001.OF'.\",\r\n              \"params\": [\r\n                {\r\n                  \"name\": \"query_type\",\r\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\r\n                  \"required\": true,\r\n                  \"description\": \"Query type: 'nav' (NAV snapshot) or 'info' (fund profile)\"\r\n                },\r\n                {\r\n                  \"name\": \"codes\",\r\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\r\n                  \"required\": true,\r\n                  \"description\": \"Fund codes, comma-separated, must use .OF suffix, e.g. '110011.OF,000001.OF' (max 50)\"\r\n                },\r\n                {\r\n                  \"name\": \"date\",\r\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\r\n                  \"required\": false,\r\n                  \"description\": \"Query date in YYYYMMDD or YYYY-MM-DD format. Required for query_type='nav'; ignored for query_type='info'.\"\r\n                }\r\n              ],\r\n              \"provider_description\": \"同花顺 (THS) iFinD data provider, offering financial data for Chinese and international markets including stocks, securities, funds, bonds, futures, etc. Supports company announcements, intelligent stock screening, industry analysis, market trend prediction, and more, helping users conduct comprehensive financial data analysis and investment decisions.\",\r\n              \"stats\": {\r\n                \"avg_execution_time_ms\": 433.15,\r\n                \"success_rate\": 0.894\r\n              },\r\n              \"expected_cost\": \"1 credits/result\"\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n              \"tool_id\": \"mcp_gildata.shareholdingdetailreport.v1\",\r\n              \"name\": \"ShareholdingDetailReport\",\r\n              \"description\": \"基金持股明细\\n\\n获取基金持仓股票明细，包括市值、占比、行业等。\",\r\n             